f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\n\\leftrightarrow f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\land f\\in\\mathcal{PR}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)","display":true}],"bytes":1001,"backlinks":[{"id":"ed30454d43d18f4c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[88-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2$ 取 [[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。$+$ 是元语言自然数加法；原始递归方案取 [[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]。"},{"id":"867fa39cfa0d7a32","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[88-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2$ 取 [[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。"},{"id":"84fe0214dffac7e4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z_k,P_i^k,\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k,\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k$ 分别取 [[88-df-zero-function]]、[[88-df-projection-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]；该递归方案的递归参数位于第一位。"},{"id":"c5514506c707c9ae","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}$ 为 [[88-df-encoding]] 的固定单射有限元组编码；$\\mathrm{Function}$ 见 [[88-df-function]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$、$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。"},{"id":"b301b626e1a834ac","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1$ (unary primitive-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"ae09a46ca7006ab7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)$ (primitive-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"7099f3791c655614","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_